{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"michael-james-shaw","name":"Michael James Shaw","birthDate":"1986-09-16","birthPlace":"New York, New York, USA","bio":"Michael James Shaw (born September 16, 1986) is an American actor and writer from New York City. He is best known for his recurring role as FBI Agent Daryl/\"Mike\" in the TV series Limitless. Shaw has also had a recurring role in Constantine as Papa Midnite and had a role in several shorts like Don-o-mite and Today _ _ cks. He also had a small role in Roots as Marcellus. Shaw portrayed Corvus Glaive in the Marvel Cinematic Universe films Avengers: Infinity War and Avengers: Endgame.\n\nShaw's very first starring role was as the Big Bad Wolf in his kindergarten production of The Three Piggy Opera at Madison Street School of Basics Plus in Ocala, Florida. Shaw graduated from Vanguard High School in 2005. Upon graduating from high school, Shaw spent his undergraduate years at Howard University. He then took a master's program at Juilliard School.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Michael James Shaw, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:46:29+00:00","tmdbId":1379821,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/1379821","credits":[{"id":"infinity-war","title":"Avengers: Infinity War","character":"Corvus Glaive"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/michael-james-shaw.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Twisted Metal","year":2023,"character":"Axel","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zMwMClR9y7RBeVWMEmNn8LwUJHz.jpg"},{"name":"Avengers: Endgame","year":2019,"character":"Corvus Glaive","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jtDv3lCnST0fZRvdYFwR5CVwK2x.jpg"},{"name":"The Enemy Within","year":2019,"character":"Visser","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/AaEEjBDTuoLA9e0e4EQDBRxwDtZ.jpg"},{"name":"The Enemy Within","year":2019,"character":"Desmond Visser","mediaType":"tv","poster":"h